{"2632140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Iron and Lead", "steam_appid": 2632140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dieselpunk roguelike where you man a trench tank and fight to survive an alien onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hold the line.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iron &amp; Lead</i> drops you into a dieselpunk trench war against relentless alien forces. As the gunner of an Abner Jack, you are the last line between humanity and collapse. Every run is a fight to survive, adapt, and push back the onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight the War Beneath the Surface</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a shifting network of trenches where danger comes from every direction. Airborne threats, ground assaults, and overwhelming enemy waves will test your awareness and positioning at every turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command the Abner Jack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of powerful trench-running tanks, each with distinct strengths and playstyles. Precision movement and timing aren’t optional—they’re survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt or Be Overrun</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy <strong>turrets</strong>, <strong>landmines</strong>, and <strong>rocket barrages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your approach with <strong>50+ items and upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build for damage, defense, or something in between</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run opens new possibilities. Every mistake has consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push Further Every Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across multiple regions, unlock new equipment, and refine your strategy with each attempt. The deeper you go, the harder the fight becomes—and the more it demands from you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stand Your Ground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war doesn’t stop. The enemy doesn’t relent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is—how long can you hold the line?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dieselpunk roguelike where you man a trench tank and fight to survive an alien onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hold the line.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iron &amp; Lead</i> drops you into a dieselpunk trench war against relentless alien forces. As the gunner of an Abner Jack, you are the last line between humanity and collapse. Every run is a fight to survive, adapt, and push back the onslaught.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight the War Beneath the Surface</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a shifting network of trenches where danger comes from every direction. Airborne threats, ground assaults, and overwhelming enemy waves will test your awareness and positioning at every turn.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command the Abner Jack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of powerful trench-running tanks, each with distinct strengths and playstyles. Precision movement and timing aren’t optional—they’re survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adapt or Be Overrun</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy <strong>turrets</strong>, <strong>landmines</strong>, and <strong>rocket barrages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your approach with <strong>50+ items and upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build for damage, defense, or something in between</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run opens new possibilities. Every mistake has consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push Further Every Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across multiple regions, unlock new equipment, and refine your strategy with each attempt. The deeper you go, the harder the fight becomes—and the more it demands from you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stand Your Ground</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war doesn’t stop. The enemy doesn’t relent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is—how long can you hold the line?</p>", "short_description": "Take control of an Abner Jack in this dieselpunk roguelike. Man the guns, deploy powerful defenses, and fight to survive a relentless alien onslaught.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632140/header.jpg?t=1774371181", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632140/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774371181", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632140/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774371181", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Window 7 64 bit or better<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 / AMD R9 290, NVIDIA GTX 970 or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radion RX 480, NVIDIA GTX 1060 (or better)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2023 Polearm Studios. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Polearm Studios"], "publishers": ["Polearm Studios"], "demos": [{"appid": 2638390, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.99"}, "packages": [943938], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Iron and Lead", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 943938, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "optio